    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Multi-model chaining pipeline: call Model A (reasoning model) for deep analysis, wrap its output in thinking tags, inject as an assistant message, then call Model B (response model) for the final response. Per-request token usage aggregation across all providers in a chain with configurable pricing tables. SSE streaming across multi-phase model calls so consumers see incremental output from each phase without waiting for the full chain to complete.\n",
